d stata-networks: Stata package for calculating network edge weights
d
d Author: Necmi TALAY
d Support: https://github.com/aggilitas/stata-networks/issues
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260207
d
d This package calculates network edge weights from node-level data.
d Supports interaction, flow, and attribute networks with multi-subnet capabilities.
d
d Requires: Stata version 16 or higher (for frame support)
d
